#
Suppose your university is selecting some students to teach kids in remote rural areas during the coming vacation. You are now to write an application letter to the university to 
explain why you want to take part and what you can do for the kids.

###
  I am writing to apply for the activity of teaching kids in remote rural areas.
  For one thing, the remote rural areas lack of basic teaching items, where kids need to be helped and I am ready for it. For another, I want to develop my responsibility 
through this meaningful activity.
  Besides, I am qualified for this activity. I am major in about teaching and I used to join a teaching match, then getting a great honor. I can teach kids well and assist them in 
finishing their tasks.
  I would appreciate it if you could consider my application. Looking forward to your reply.


### 逐处错误标注
1. lack of → lack；lack 作动词直接用 lack sth，短语 be lacking in sth；the remote rural areas lack basic teaching resources
3. develop my responsibility → develop my sense of responsibility；“培养责任感” 固定表达
4. I am major in → I major in / My major is；major 作动词，不用 am major in
5. major in about teaching → major in education；major in 后面直接加专业名词，去掉 about
6. used to join → have taken part in；used to do 表示过去常常（现在不做了），这里表达曾经参加过活动用现在完成时更合适
7. then getting → and won；此处并列谓语，不用分词 getting
8. assist them in finishing their tasks → assist them with their schoolwork；tasks 指代模糊，作文用 schoolwork（课业）更贴合支教场景


