### 逐处错误标注
1. apply for taking part → apply to take part （apply to do sth. 申请做某事；apply for 后接名词）
2. due to lacking of → because of the lack of （lack 作名词：the lack of；lack 作动词直接用 lack sth.，没有 lacking of）
3. contribute to help → try my best to help （contribute to doing，原搭配错误，改写更贴合四级）
4. fond of educated bussiness → fond of education （educated 是形容词；business 拼写错误，表意生硬）
5. as well as can assist → and I can assist （as well as 不能接句子，只能接名词 / 动名词）
6. majoy → major（拼写错误）
7. I had taken → I have taken （没有过去时间参照，不用过去完成时，用现在完成时）
8. conpetitions → competitions（拼写错误）
9. have ability → have the ability（固定搭配，要加 the）
10. schoolworks → schoolwork（不可数名词，无复数）


